Z||000000||ray b||12-28-2001||10:27 PM||||HOW DO YOU turn a 4 sided eazy out<BR>I hve tryed and broken a 12 point 1/2"drive 10mm socket and a 8 pointer and can't find a 4 sided driver that will fit damm eazy out is just a little tooooo small at just under 3/8 thats why I used a 10mm socket but impacts are all 6 sided and will not fit<BR>still trying to get a broken plug out HELP<P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
